@startuml
title Unidirectional Data Flow (UI → VM → Logic → Platform → VM → UI)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor User
participant "UI Layer\n(Compose Screens)" as UI
participant "ViewModel\n(ui-shared)" as VM
participant "Shared Logic\n(core)" as Logic
participant "Platform Services\n(Android/Desktop)" as Platform
== User Interaction ==
User -> UI: User Action (tap, type, gesture)
UI -> VM: onEvent(Event)
== ViewModel Processing ==
VM -> VM: Update State
VM -> Logic: Invoke shared logic\n(audio, storage, STT, etc.)
== Shared Logic ==
Logic -> Platform: Call platform implementation
Platform --> Logic: Return results
== Back to ViewModel ==
Logic --> VM: Processed data
VM -> VM: Reduce into new State
VM --> UI: Emit State + Effects
== UI Update ==
UI -> User: Render updated UI
@enduml
